    <p><strong>Age Recommendation:</strong> Parental advisory: Explicit language.</p><p>Everyone, regardless of age, must have their own ticket to enter the theatre. Children under the age of 16 must be accompanied by, and seated next to, a ticketholder who is at least 18 years old. Children under the age of 3 will not be admitted.</p><p><strong>Please note:</strong> This production contains strobe lighting, flashing lights and gunshots.</p>
    
